        "original_id": "4070f4be-3c1e-53f4-86fe-dc61efd040e0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Paolo Cannavaro, Fabio Cannavaro\n- Organizations: Napoli, Parma, Sassuolo, Tianjin Quanjian\n- Roles: footballer, defender, manager, coach\n- Awards: FIFA World Cup, Ballon d'Or\n\nFacts:\n- Fabio Cannavaro was born on 13 September 1973 and is an Italian former professional footballer.\n- Paolo Cannavaro was born on 26 June 1981 and is an Italian footballer who plays for Sassuolo as a defender.\n- Paolo Cannavaro began his career with Napoli and moved to Parma in 1999.\n- At Parma, Paolo Cannavaro played alongside his older brother Fabio Cannavaro.\n- Fabio Cannavaro was also a defender.\n- Fabio Cannavaro won the 2006 FIFA World Cup and the Ballon d'Or.\n- Fabio Cannavaro is the current manager or coach of the Chinese club Tianjin Quanjian.",
